note The icons the GUI draws, by what they mean rather than what they look like: Add (the picker), Close, SplitRight and SplitDown, Back and Forward, Expanded and Collapsed (a collapse's or a group's chevron, named after ViewFlag::Collapsed and Collapse/Expand; Close is the dismiss icon, a different thing), MoreAbove and MoreBelow (context), Check (a symbol some tour covers, in the Symbols tab). A new icon is a variant here and its Codicons codepoint in glyph.

