note Each icon's Codicons codepoint, from the font's own table (codicon.csv in the package): add EA60, close EA76, split-horizontal EB56, split-vertical EB57, arrow-left EA9B, arrow-right EA9C, chevron-down EAB4, chevron-right EAB6, fold-up EAF4, fold-down EAF3, check EAB2.

